BT /F2 12.5 Tf 50 720 Td (01. Master Privacy Policy & DPDP Act 2023 Governance) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 700 Td (TechPath operates under strict compliance with India's Digital Personal Data Protection \(DPDP\) Act, 2023,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 686.5 Td (the Information Technology Act, 2000, and global data privacy standards. All consent obtained from students) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 673 Td (is free, specific, informed, unconditional, and unambiguous.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 651.5 Td (Categories of Personal Data Collected:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 638 Td (- Name, email address, password hash, and Google OAuth UID for identity segregation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 624.5 Td (- Academic profile: Engineering department, semester, and target skills to tailor learning modules.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 611 Td (- Profile photos uploaded voluntarily, stored in isolated Supabase storage buckets.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 597.5 Td (- Uploaded lecture slides and PDF notes, parsed locally or in transient buffers solely for study assistance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 584 Td (- AI queries submitted to AI Doubt Solver and AI Copilot, proxied securely without student identity headers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 570.5 Td (- Mock interview audio and video data, processed locally in session memory without surveillance retention.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 557 Td (- Diagnostic telemetry: Browser user-agent and IP addresses utilized solely for security rate limiting.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 535.5 Td (Cross-Border Processing & Third Parties:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 522 Td (Infrastructure is hosted on enterprise cloud providers \(Supabase PostgreSQL, Google Gemini API, OpenAI\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 508.5 Td (Any cross-border transit is governed under standard contractual clauses with end-to-end TLS 1.3 encryption.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 487 Td (Withdrawal of Consent & Erasure:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 473.5 Td (Students maintain the statutory right to withdraw consent at any time by emailing lakkimsettirahulashokh@gmail.com.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 460 Td (Upon withdrawal, active sessions are revoked immediately and account records are purged within 30 days.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 50 431.5 Td (02. Master Terms of Use & Conditions) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 411.5 Td (These Terms of Use govern all access to TechPath web applications, databases, and microservices.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 398 Td (By accessing the platform, users agree to the following enforceable terms:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 376.5 Td (- Account Responsibility: Users are responsible for preserving credential confidentiality.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 363 Td (- Acceptable Academic Use: Intended strictly for legitimate undergraduate engineering preparation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 349.5 Td (- Prohibited Activities: Automated crawling, scraping, denial-of-service attempts, reverse engineering,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 336 Td (  and posting abusive, fraudulent, or malicious payloads are strictly prohibited.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 322.5 Td (- Account Suspension: TechPath reserves the right to suspend accounts breaching platform guidelines.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 309 Td (- Availability: The platform is provided on an 'as is' and 'as available' basis without warranties of) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 295.5 Td (  uninterrupted availability during emergency maintenance or third-party outages.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 282 Td (- Limitation of Liability: TechPath's direct liability is limited to actual fees paid in the preceding) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 268.5 Td (  twelve months, disclaiming consequential, indirect, or punitive damages.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 255 Td (- Jurisdiction: Governed under the laws of India, subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 241.5 Td (  courts in Hyderabad / Andhra Pradesh, India.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 50 213 Td (03. Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) Technology Disclaimers) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 193 Td (TechPath incorporates advanced generative AI models \(including Google Gemini and OpenAI architectures\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 179.5 Td (Users must understand the technical nature and limitations of artificial intelligence:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 158 Td (- Inherent Probabilistic Output: AI models may generate factual inaccuracies, outdated programming) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 144.5 Td (  syntax, mathematical errors, or hallucinations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 131 Td (- Independent Verification Mandatory: TechPath is an educational assistant and does not guarantee the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 117.5 Td (  accuracy, completeness, suitability, or outcome of AI responses. Students must verify critical) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 104 Td (  formulas, theorems, and code against authoritative textbooks and official university syllabi.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 90.5 Td (- Module Disclaimers: Applies to AI Doubt Solver, AI Copilot, PDF Analyzer, AI Notes, and Mock Interview.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 77 Td (- Non-Expert Advice: AI output does not constitute certified legal, medical, financial, or engineering counsel.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 50 760 Td (TechPath AI OS - Master Legal & Compliance Framework v2.4) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 480 760 Td (Statutory Notice) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 50 35 Td (Grievance Officer: lakkimsettirahulashokh@gmail.com | Hyderabad, India) Tj ET
