BT /F2 12.5 Tf 50 720 Td (04. Uploaded PDF & Content Copyright Governance) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 700 Td (The PDF Analyzer and AI Notes generator allow students to extract learning insights from study materials.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 678.5 Td (- No Ownership Transfer: Uploading documents DOES NOT transfer copyright ownership to TechPath. TechPath) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 665 Td (  acquires no proprietary claims over student materials and has no right to resell or redistribute them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 651.5 Td (- User Warranty: Users warrant that they possess legal ownership, license, or valid fair-dealing rights.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 638 Td (- Indian Copyright Act 1957: Section 52\(1\)\(a\)\(i\) permits fair dealing for private study, non-commercial) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 624.5 Td (  research, and academic instruction. TechPath is engineered strictly to support individual research.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 611 Td (- Ephemeral Retention: Uploaded documents are parsed in temporary memory and are never made public.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 597.5 Td (- Notice and Takedown: Copyright holders may submit infringement notifications to:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 584 Td (  lakkimsettirahulashokh@gmail.com. We acknowledge receipt within 24-48 hours and act promptly.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 50 555.5 Td (05. Third-Party Content, Links & YouTube Attribution) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 535.5 Td (TechPath references third-party educational resources to enrich undergraduate study pathways:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 514 Td (- YouTube Video Player: External video lectures in LearnHub are embedded directly from YouTube via the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 500.5 Td (  official player in compliance with YouTube Developer Terms. TechPath does not host or pirate video files.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 487 Td (- No Implied Affiliation: Mentions of universities \(IITs, MIT, Stanford\) or corporate certifications) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 473.5 Td (  do not constitute endorsement, official sponsorship, or commercial affiliation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 460 Td (- Authentic Hyperlinks: TechPath only provides verified links and never fabricates false references.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 50 431.5 Td (06. User Reviews & Community Standards) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 411.5 Td (TechPath features peer reviews to guide students across technical modules and career paths:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 390 Td (- Truthful Representation: Reviews must reflect authentic, verifiable student experiences.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 376.5 Td (- Prohibited Submissions: Defamatory, abusive, obscene, harassing, or commercial spam will be removed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 363 Td (- Moderation Authority: Platform administrators reserve the right to review and remove violating content.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 349.5 Td (- Public Attribution: Submitting a review confirms consent to display chosen name, branch, and rating.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 50 321 Td (07. Advertising & Sponsored Content Transparency) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 301 Td (Where commercial advertisements or sponsored educational resources appear on the platform:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 279.5 Td (- Clear Labeling: All sponsored units are clearly marked with 'Sponsored' or 'Ad' labels.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 266 Td (- No Disguised Ads: Advertisements will never be disguised as academic curricula or mandatory coursework.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 252.5 Td (- Zero Artificial Clicks: Platform operators and users must not artificially click ads or deploy click-bots.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 239 Td (- Policy Compliance: Ad operations adhere to Google AdSense guidelines and Indian advertising standards.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 50 210.5 Td (08. Cookies, Local Storage & Telemetry Notice) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 190.5 Td (TechPath prioritizes client-side data isolation over intrusive tracking:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 169 Td (- Essential Tokens: Secure cryptographic session tokens stored to maintain authenticated login sessions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 155.5 Td (- Client Preferences: LocalStorage keys preserving dark mode, 3D WebGL motion, and sidebar states.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 142 Td (- Study Stopwatch: Local timestamps caching study duration counters across accidental browser reloads.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 128.5 Td (- Zero Covert Tracking: TechPath does not sell tracking cookies, device fingerprints, or ad identifiers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 115 Td (- User Control: Students may wipe client storage at any time via browser settings.) Tj ET
