BT /F2 12.5 Tf 50 720 Td (09. Account Deletion, Erasure & Retention Framework) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 700 Td (Students hold the statutory right to erase their accounts and purge all associated personal data:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 678.5 Td (- Deletion Process: Send an email from your registered address to lakkimsettirahulashokh@gmail.com) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 665 Td (  with the subject 'Permanent Account Erasure Request'.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 651.5 Td (- Backend Execution: Upon verification, profile records, saved study packs, and avatars are permanently) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 638 Td (  purged from PostgreSQL database storage within thirty \(30\) days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 624.5 Td (- Statutory Retention Exceptions: Minimal audit logs or dispute records are retained only where mandated) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 611 Td (  by statutory tax, security incident reporting, or cybersecurity laws.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 50 582.5 Td (10. Platform Security & Data Protection Architecture) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 562.5 Td (TechPath employs a robust defense-in-depth architecture across all microservices:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 541 Td (- Row Level Security \(RLS\): PostgreSQL database tables enforce strict tenant isolation policies so) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 527.5 Td (  students can access only their own records.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 514 Td (- Cryptography: HTTPS/TLS 1.3 encryption in transit and AES-256 encryption at rest.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 500.5 Td (- Zero Client API Keys: LLM provider secrets \(Gemini, OpenAI\) are strictly isolated on server runtimes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 487 Td (- File Validation: Uploads are restricted by MIME type and size capped at 25MB.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 473.5 Td (- Vulnerability Reporting: Responsible researchers may report issues to lakkimsettirahulashokh@gmail.com.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 50 445 Td (11. Statutory Grievance Redressal Mechanism & Officer) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 425 Td (Pursuant to Rule 3\(2\) of the Information Technology Intermediary Rules, 2021, and Section 13 of the) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 411.5 Td (DPDP Act, 2023, TechPath has appointed a designated Grievance Officer:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 390 Td (- Grievance Officer: Rahul Ashok Lakkimsetti) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 376.5 Td (- Role: Lead Administrator & Data Protection Custodian) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 363 Td (- Official Desk: lakkimsettirahulashokh@gmail.com) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 349.5 Td (- Jurisdiction: Andhra Pradesh / Hyderabad, India) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 336 Td (- Service Level Agreements \(SLAs\): Formal acknowledgement within 24 to 48 hours; full investigation and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 322.5 Td (  redressal communicated in writing within 15 calendar days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 309 Td (- Appellate Remedy: Appeals may be escalated to the Grievance Appellate Committee \(GAC\) or Data Protection Board.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 50 280.5 Td (12. Intellectual Property & Brand Protection) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 260.5 Td (All original elements of TechPath are protected under intellectual property legislation:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 239 Td (- Proprietary Assets: TechPath brand name, logos, typography, visual layouts, and curriculum hierarchies.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 225.5 Td (- Code & Workflows: Source code, prompt pipelines, and IDE sandboxes are proprietary works.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 212 Td (- Restrictions: Unauthorized mirroring, decompilation, scraping, or commercial resale is prohibited.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 50 183.5 Td (13. Educational Outcomes, Career & Examination Disclaimers) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 163.5 Td (TechPath provides learning roadmaps and examination preparation materials for guidance only:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 142 Td (- No Employment Guarantee: Mock interviews, roadmaps, and resume reviews do not guarantee jobs or placements.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 128.5 Td (- No Academic Marks Warranty: Passing scores, college GPAs, and certifications depend on university grading.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 60 115 Td (- Official Authority Verification: Exam dates, syllabus, and cutoffs for GATE, UPSC ESE, GRE, CAT, etc.,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 101.5 Td (  must always be confirmed directly with official conducting bodies.) Tj ET
